; heat-witness-mutual: the exact shape probe (b) claimed went uncounted —
; mutual tail calls, 30M dispatches. If the heat file names ping and pong
; with ~15M each at exit, the "pulses=0" reading is explained by the old
; pre-execution report (and the 64M pulse floor), not by uncounted calls.
(defn pong (n) (if (le n 0) 0 (ping (sub n 1))))
(defn ping (n) (if (le n 0) 0 (pong (sub n 1))))
(ping 30000000)
